This reduced rate applies to the following items (and CN codes) for the exclusive use of the disabled (part 2):
- hoists (8425 11 90 and 8425 19 91);
- platform lift/swimming pool lifters (8428 10 91 and 8428 20 99);
- chairlifts (8428 60 00);
- bath tub lifters (8428 90 98);
- lifts to get wheelchair into a car (8428 90 98);
- braille typewriters (8469 12 00, 8469 20 00 and 8469 30 00);
